    <h1 class="msv-hero__title">Living in the Canary Islands: Expat Guide to Visas, Costs, and Life</h1>
    <p class="msv-hero__intro">The Canary Islands — Tenerife, Gran Canaria, Lanzarote, Fuerteventura, and the rest — are part of Spain but sit off the coast of Africa, just north of the Tropic of Cancer. The result: year-round warmth, consistently mild winters, and a lifestyle that attracts retirees and remote workers from across Europe and beyond.</p>
  </div>
